. The crew are suspicious, but Setsuna suggests they set course for this mysterious location.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-03-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4eWHX2rNAuAXLowImhje0MqUbw6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4eWHX2rNAuAXLowImhje0MqUbw6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/2/episode/21"},{"id":"599667","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The A-LAWS and Federation Forces are gathering a huge fleet to exterminate Celestial Being, and their leaders anticipate a final decisive battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-03-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gDb3QwuTRuC7Xh9tAZYUvh15QUh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gDb3QwuTRuC7Xh9tAZYUvh15QUh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/2/episode/22"},{"id":"599668","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Innovator Regene Regetta finally rebels against Ribbons Almark.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-03-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5kLho17YLDO6WzpZeLEGjoin25f.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5kLho17YLDO6WzpZeLEGjoin25f.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21732/season/2/episode/23"},{"id":"599669","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Tieria enters the enemy ship and learns shocking truths, the Ptolemaios 2 fights a defensive battle against the unrelenting enemy assault. One by one, our heroes fall. Setsuna cries out as if responding to the fading light